## Operator guidance

> Address the two Browser tests failures from run 45512255292 within #33. The Forgotten Archive browser journey at tests/e2e/bbs.spec.ts:382 times out on log .ai-fictional after SUBMIT DEFERRED. Trace the actual confirmation output and existing #35 journey; assert the fresh verified confirmation with the correct semantics and verify each branch reaches its proof. The production entry was 62.667 KiB gzip against the existing 60 KiB limit. Measure with the existing gzipSync budget calculation and reduce the real entry; preserve all content and thresholds, avoid moving the Story data into engine code, verify production assets and startup still behave. Keep changes scoped, preserve #35 gameplay, and leave Chromium execution to Browser tests CI.

